----------------------------------------------------------------------
Just post the contents of the README. Additionally these lines should be =
posted:

"Besides being the first time the packages mathtools and mhsetup are =
made publicly available, this release also marks the upgrade of empheq =
to version 2.11. Users of empheq are encouraged to upgrade as soon as =
possible as this version fixes various minor bugs and also ensures full =
compatibility with hyperref and showkeys. All but the core features of =
version 2.00 have been moved to the mathtools package, which is now a =
required part of empheq.

Henceforth empheq is a part of the mh bundle =
(CTAN:/macros/latex/contrib/mh), and CTAN:macros/latex/contrib/empheq =
will cease to exist."

I've provided an "unpacked" folder containing the runtime files. I don't =
know how you feel about having something like that on CTAN, so feel free =
to do with it as you like.

btw I'm offline for the next week or so (starting right now), so I hope =
there are no questions ;-)

Cheers
